flowchart LR
    H[Human listener] -->|genre, mood, energy, acoustic preference| CLI[CLI input and validation]
    CLI --> APP[Application runner]
    CSV[(Curated songs.csv)] --> LOAD[Catalog loader]
    LOAD --> APP
    APP --> SCORE[Content-based scoring]
